  "description": "LoveHome Properties are delighted to present this exceptional detached bungalow nestled in the heart of the highly sought-after Bunratty countryside.\n\nSet on a generous half-acre site with picturesque views of the surrounding farmland, this beautifully presented home offers the perfect blend of rural tranquillity and modern convenience. Wake up each morning to the peace and quiet of the Clare countryside while being just minutes from Bunratty Village and within easy commuting distance of Limerick City, Shannon, Ennis and Galway.\n\nThis superb property enjoys an enviable location approximately 2km from the world-famous Bunratty Castle & Folk Park, together with a host of local amenities including shops, cafés, restaurants, schools, sporting facilities and excellent transport links.\n\nThe bright and spacious accommodation comprises:\n\n✅ Entrance Hallway\n✅ Spacious Open-Plan Living / Kitchen / Dining Area\n✅ Utility Room\n✅ 3 Generous Bedrooms (2 Double Bedrooms & 1 Queen Bedroom)\n✅ 2 Bathrooms\n✅ Ample Storage Throughout\n\nOutside, the property is surrounded by mature grounds on a private half-acre site with extensive parking and uninterrupted countryside views. The setting is ideal for those seeking a peaceful lifestyle while remaining connected to major employment centres including Shannon Free Zone, Raheen Business Park, University Hospital Limerick, Shannon Airport and Ennis Town.\n",
